# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets headers.
# Served from dist/_headers (copied from public/_headers by Astro).
# Specific rules first: hashed Astro bundles in /_astro/* are content-addressed,
# so they are safe to cache immutably for a year. Everything else gets a short
# 1-day fresh window with a 1-year stale-while-revalidate grace period so the
# Cloudflare edge can serve stale content while revalidating in the background.

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=31536000
